Description:It is your first main phase. You control Bog Wraith (3/3, swampwalk) and have Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth in hand; you have not played a land this turn. The opponent is at 3 life and controls a Plains and an untapped Grizzly Bears. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-landwalk-type-change | Landwalk checks the land types the defending player's lands have (CR 702.14c), and Urborg makes every land a Swamp (CR 305.7): play Urborg and the opponent's Plains is a Swamp, so Bog Wraith can't be blocked and deals 3; without it the Bears block
